Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant tables & columns (key ones first)

• “HUMAN_GENOME_VARIANTS.HUMAN_GENOME_VARIANTS._1000_GENOMES_PHASE_3_OPTIMIZED_SCHEMA_VARIANTS_20150220”  
  – “reference_bases” : filter records that equal ‘AT’ or ‘TA’.  
  – “start_position”   : measure we will aggregate (MIN / MAX, counts, etc.).  
  – “partition_date_please_ignore” : keep only the 2015‑02‑20 partition (safety check although all rows in this table should already belong to that date).  

Optional / helping columns  
  – “end_position”  : may be inspected to be sure variants are two‑base substitutions.  
  – “quality”, “filter” : quality control if you want to remove low‑quality rows (e.g., WHERE "filter" ILIKE '%PASS%').  

Typical conditions that may be useful  
  1) "reference_bases" IN ('AT','TA')  
  2) "partition_date_please_ignore" = '2015‑02‑20'  
  3) "filter" = '["PASS"]'   (only pass variants)  

